# ------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT ignore:
#
# README.md
# *.ipynb
# *.py
# tests/
# src/
# requirements.txt
# .gitignore
#
# These are part of the project source and documentation.
